oblems — killing animals, making clothes, refining advanced materials — building power systems.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883840/extras/78170216980982cf8cfca011ee244f8e.poster.avif?t=1768391709\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883840/extras/78170216980982cf8cfca011ee244f8e.webm?t=1768391709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883840/extras/78170216980982cf8cfca011ee244f8e.mp4?t=1768391709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883840/extras/6f9675625795d2eb0a62fda0ec29d949.poster.avif?t=1768391709\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883840/extras/6f9675625795d2eb0a62fda0ec29d949.webm?t=1768391709\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1883840/extras/6f9675625795d2eb0a62fda0ec29d949.mp4?t=1768391709\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
